OL,5,Amidterms hopes
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocrats flip their first Senate seat
OL,8,Fof the night, taking North Carolina
OL,9,Ffrom the Republicans
OL,11,FMeanwhile, Senator Jon Ossoff is
OL,12,Fre-elected in Georgia - see results as
OL,13,Fthey come in across the US
OL,15,FWhat's up for election? All 435 seats
OL,16,Fin the House; 35 of the 100 seats in
OL,17,Fthe Senate; and some state-level
OL,18,Fpoliticians, including governors
